{
	"UUID": "7a6f94c8-f959-4dd5-9b58-cb5ae0137b96",
	"Name": "Okta Sign-In Location Overview",
	"Description": "Where your Okta sign-ins actually come from. Countries, cities, and network operators come from Okta's own client.geographicalContext and securityContext, which Okta resolves at the edge at request time; the maxmind and asn_db resources from the Gravwell Network Enrichment kit fill in only for the events that arrive without Okta's enrichment.\n\nThe network operator card is the one to read carefully: authentication arriving from a cloud hosting provider rather than a residential or corporate ISP is worth explaining.\n\nThe two bottom tiles are the detections that key on geography.",
